window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>A petty thief on the run in the modern world. A medieval Scots lass who craves adventure. Two worlds will collide.</i></b><br> <br> Forced to flee America, petty criminal Joey Finnegan finds more trouble than he bargained for in the land of whisky and kilts. Then a strange force hurls him backward in time, dropping him into a castle moat.<br> <br> But a lovely lass fishes him out.<br> <br> Rachel MacTaggart comes from an odd family. And everyone, from her parents to her great-aunts, wants to know who the goateed stranger in a leather coat is. How he got here. Why he came. What he wants.<br> <br> Joey can't tell them, because he has no answers. But that's not his only problem. A thief in their midst? These people would probably run him through with a sword if he confessed to that fact.<br> <br> Yet someone or something flung him into this medieval world. The question is why.<br> <br> <b><i>Treachery in the Highlands is the second time travel prequel inspired by the best-selling Hot Scots series.</i></b></p>"; 
